stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> Registered: project + documents + dataset
    Registered --> Queued: POST /api/runs
    Queued --> Running: worker picks the job
    Running --> Scoring: RAG answered + cited
    Scoring --> Aggregated: metrics computed per item
    Aggregated --> Completed: all items scored
    Running --> Cancelled: cancel requested
    Running --> Failed: item error / budget stop
    Completed --> Gated: release policy evaluated
    Gated --> Passed: every hard rule passed
    Gated --> Failed: a hard rule failed
    Gated --> Inconclusive: missing or insufficient evidence
    Completed --> Compared: baseline vs candidate
    Compared --> Drifted: distribution analysis
    Passed --> [*]
    Failed --> [*]
    Inconclusive --> [*]
    Drifted --> [*]
    Cancelled --> [*]
    Failed --> [*]
